# files matching each pattern. The default rule (first line) catches
# anything not matched by a later, more specific rule. The specific
# rules below mark CI/build infrastructure as requiring maintainer
# review so a bad workflow edit or a malicious Tauri build script
# cannot ship without a human looking at it.
#
# Syntax reference:
#   https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Note: paths are anchored at the repo root. A leading slash is the
# default (root-anchored). Patterns without a leading slash match
# anywhere in the tree — be deliberate.

# Default: maintainers team
